---
import { url } from '../../lib/url';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import summary from '../../data/develop/summary.json';
---

<Layout title="Develop" side="develop" description="ONGA curation and QA dashboard">
  <div class="space-y-12">
    <section class="text-center py-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Develop</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Curation dashboard for developing the ONGA vocabulary. Review embeddings analysis,
        make cleanup decisions, then export a changeset to apply back to the schema.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <a href={url("/develop/merge-candidates")} class="block bg-white rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border-l-4 border-orange-500">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-orange-600">{summary.mergeCandidates}</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Merge Candidates</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Highly similar term pairs that may be duplicates</p>
      </a>
      <a href={url("/develop/gaps")} class="block bg-white rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border-l-4 border-red-500">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-red-600">{summary.gapTerms}</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Gap Terms</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Terms with no close match in external ontologies</p>
      </a>
      <a href={url("/develop/mapping-suggestions")} class="block bg-white rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border-l-4 border-blue-500">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600">{summary.mappingSuggestions}</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Mapping Suggestions</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Terms with suggested EDAM/OBI/GO mappings</p>
      </a>
      <a href={url("/develop/quality-issues")} class="block bg-white rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border-l-4 border-yellow-500">
        <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-600">{summary.qualityIssues}</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Quality Issues</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Structural and categorization problems</p>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Curate &rarr; Export &rarr; Apply</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-400 mb-2">1. Curate</div>
          <p>Review each tool's findings and make per-item decisions (merge, keep, delete, adopt mapping). Decisions are stored in your browser's localStorage.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-400 mb-2">2. Export</div>
          <p>Visit the <a href={url("/develop/changeset")} class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Changeset</a> page to review all decisions and download a <code>changeset.json</code> file.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-400 mb-2">3. Apply</div>
          <p>Run <code>make apply CHANGESET=changeset.json</code> to rewrite <code>file_content.yaml</code>, then rebuild the site.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
